sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as User / Automation Client
    participant CLI as CLI / Entrypoint Layer
    participant Daemon as Daemon / Core Orchestrator
    participant Worker as Worker Agents / Subprocesses
    participant DB as SQLite / Local Store
    participant LLM as External LLM Gateways / APIs

    Caller->>CLI: Invokes command (flags + args)
    activate CLI
    CLI->>CLI: Pre-flight checks & env validation
    alt Pre-flight check fails
        CLI-->>Caller: 14 passed · ✗ Critical Failure
    else Pre-flight ready
        CLI->>Daemon: Send command / connect session
        activate Daemon
        Daemon->>DB: Load active profiles & session state
        DB-->>Daemon: State loaded
        Daemon->>Worker: Spawn worker terminal (tmux)
        activate Worker
        Worker->>LLM: Dispatch turn (stream-json / prompt)
        activate LLM
        alt Quota Exceeded / 429 Rate Limit
            LLM-->>Worker: 429 Too Many Requests
            Worker-->>Daemon: Quota Exceeded Event
            Daemon->>Daemon: Execute Universal Fallback Ladder
            Daemon->>Worker: Reassign task to peer engine
        else Turn Success
            LLM-->>Worker: Generation response
        end
        deactivate LLM
        Worker->>DB: Record tokens & task updates
        Worker-->>Daemon: Task complete / report ready
        deactivate Worker
        Daemon-->>CLI: Return execution status
        deactivate Daemon
        CLI-->>Caller: Output rendered results / exit 0
    end
    deactivate CLI
